abstract: >-
  Human-directed, AI-assisted working draft and companion verification suite
  studying quantitative stability around Hermite extremizers, exact finite free
  CLT Fisher-information asymptotics, and l^p-Stam inequalities for finite free
  additive convolution, including exact rational and 50-digit interval-arithmetic
  certificates.
